1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
As kids, we love the heroes.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,660
But as adults, we understand the villains.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,840
Life teaches us that people aren't simply good or bad.

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:13,940
Sometimes the villain is just someone who got tired of being hurt.

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,720
Someone who stopped explaining themselves.

6
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,500
Someone who finally chose themselves after being forgotten.
